; Rifled-barrel (up_bm16_barrel_narezka) hud: that upgrade sets hud = this section, so it MUST
; exist or install_upgrade fatals. Inherits the base hud -- and needs NO colour remap of its own:
; the base hud's NAME-keyed ammo_bone_type_<cartridge> keys keep each shell's colour correct after
; the upgrade shifts the ammo_class indices (that is what GS's ammo_params_section_0/1 swap did).
[wpn_bm16_hud_inverted_ammotypes]:wpn_bm16_hud

